### Error/problem faced

A potential problem can occur when the required model checkpoint is not present in the local project directory.

The generation process depends on the correct checkpoint file being available. If the checkpoint cannot be downloaded or the filename does not match the selected model, model loading can fail.

### Resolution

The checkpoint filename generation and existence check were reviewed.

The project automatically attempts to download the required checkpoint when it is missing. The configuration file corresponding to the selected model was also checked to ensure that the model and configuration remain consistent.

